@node D-Bus Service
@chapter D-Bus Service

@cindex D-Bus
@cindex org.cmacs.Editor
@cindex org.cmacs.Editor1

CMacs exposes a session-bus D-Bus service so external processes ---
shell scripts, file managers, language clients, custom dashboards,
other editors, AI agents --- can talk to a running cmacs through
typed methods, watch live state via Properties, and react to events
via signals.

This chapter is mirrored in @file{doc_org/cmacs/dbus/} --- the Org
files are the primary interactive reference and the two directories
must stay in sync (run @file{tools/sync-docs.sh}).

